# Scarecrow — provider keys. Set the key for whichever provider you want; the tool
# auto-detects from whichever key is present (or be explicit with --provider).
#
# Quick start:  `crow init` creates this file for you, and `crow doctor`
# checks that your key, the browser, and Node are all good to go.

# Anthropic (default) — https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini — https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Groq — https://console.groq.com/keys
# GROQ_API_KEY=

# Ollama — local & keyless (no line here). Install from https://ollama.com/download,
# run `ollama serve`, and `ollama pull qwen3-vl`, then pick it with `--provider ollama`.

# Optional overrides
# PROVIDER=anthropic   # force a provider: anthropic | gemini | groq | ollama
# MODEL=               # override the model for the chosen provider
